ou so much! I really admire your art style and would be happy if you draw my VTuber!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1M1wgdgl8rQeKcHD0DAaiTwSTZRT4lPo1?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@non_arunoa/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c0de5e7f/uploads/origins/aa0baef2-91e8-466f-ae33-bcc2c59f8db2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1ca107b45f6a6f410a40a3401e8aa1aa", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c0de5e7f/uploads/origins/aa0baef2-91e8-466f-ae33-bcc2c59f8db2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1ca107b45f6a6f410a40a3401e8aa1aa, https://si.imgix.net/c0de5e7f/uploads/origins/aa0baef2-91e8-466f-ae33-bcc2c59f8db2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=37f31b9352ff7f44a8e54191febe76c5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c0de5e7f/uploads/origins/aa0baef2-91e8-466f-ae33-bcc2c59f8db2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a2472e370795dd218ac46ca21b73f599 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, i really love your artstyle omg i would like you to draw my OC if you accept it !\n\n▼ Important details :\nthe cat ears are small and very round (and white)\nshe has small breasts\nshe got a cute and round face\nshe got power bouton on his eyes (neon effect)\n\nReference of my oc : https://ibb.co/qMBkp7Vd\n\nhttps://ibb.co/qMBkp7Vd", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}